  "description": "I am the icon of absolute power, master of all, the ultimate necromancer king who controls death: Lord Karnak. But what’s the point of a life like this when I’m nothing but bones? Enjoying a gentle breeze, warm sunlight, human warmth, or even a decent meal are all out of the question! My loyal servant Baroth and I have tried vampirism and spiritual possession, but neither worked on ultimate transcendental beings like us. So perhaps being human again is the answer! Surely nothing will go wrong…\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
